  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tackling Serious and Organised Crime Ghana (GIZ Governance for Inclusive Development)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme will increase the capacity and commitment of government and civil society to tackle Serious and Organised Crime (SOC). It has been designed to focus on two of the highest priority threats impacting the UK and Ghana: cyber-enabled crime and illicit financial flows (IFF), particularly, around asset recovery and management and beneficial ownership.</narrative>
  </description>
